.SH "NAME"
miktex-fontmaps \- manage PDF/PostScript font maps
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.HP \w'\fBmiktex\fR\ 'u
\fBmiktex\fR [\fIcommon\-option\fR...] fontmaps \fIcommand\fR [\fIcommand\-option\-or\-parameter\fR...]
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.PP
Commands for managing
PDF/PostScript
font maps\&.
.SH "COMMANDS"
.PP
\fBconfigure\fR
.RS 4
.\" PDF/PostScript font map files: configuring
Configure font map files for
PDF/PostScript
output drivers\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBset\-option\fR \fIname\fR [\fIvalue\fR]
.RS 4
Set a configuration option\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBshow\-option\fR [\fB\-\-template \fR\fB\fItemplate\fR\fR] \fIname\fR
.RS 4
Show a configuration option\&.
.sp
\fItemplate\fR
controls the output\&. It can contain the following placeholders:
.sp
{name}, {value}
.RE
